<package name="hcxdumptool" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>A tool to capture packets wlan devices</title>
  <description>A tool to capture packets from wlan devices and detect weak
point within own WiFi networks - designed to run on Raspberry Pi's.
Capture format pcapng is compatible to Wireshark and tshark.

</description>
  <url>https://github.com/ZerBea/hcxdumptool</url>
</package>
